         * affect the permissions of the page.
         * If it only covers partial of the TLB page, set the size to 1 since
         * the allowed permissions of the region may be different from other
         * region of the page.
         */
        if (pmp_sa <= tlb_sa && pmp_ea >= tlb_ea) {
